message: "Please cite P-System if you use this software in your research."
title: "P-System: Deterministic Event Processing for Distributed Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: "Amodio"
    given-names: "Paolo"
version: "0.1.0"
license: "Apache-2.0"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Experimental Python implementation and Lean 4 formal model exploring
  deterministic event processing, causal ordering, canonical event
  identity, conflict handling, and local state projection in distributed
  systems.
keywords:
  - distributed systems
  - event processing
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - causal ordering
